# Observation log — {{CLIENT_NAME}}

One row per **observed action**. Capture events, not summaries — the raw sequence is what reveals the loops and the dead time. Summarising happens in `current-state-workflow.md`, downstream.

Ids are append-only and never reused. Everything downstream cites them.

**Class:** `observed` (an FDE watched it) · `system` (a log or export) · `documented` (an SOP) · `stated` (someone said so).
**Tell:** `repeat` · `paste` · `switch` · `dead` · `—`

